1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,706
Open README.md in the week folder chosen by your instructor,
in your own ai-learning.

2
00:00:06,706 --> 00:00:13,254
Read the teaching material in the instructor repository and
write in your own file.

3
00:00:13,254 --> 00:00:14,596
Click the pencil.

4
00:00:14,596 --> 00:00:18,225
If it is missing, check ownership and sign-in.

5
00:00:18,225 --> 00:00:23,511
If you are asked to fork or propose changes, stop and ask
for help.

6
00:00:23,511 --> 00:00:26,511
Pause here and check your own screen.

7
00:00:26,511 --> 00:00:29,307
Keep the headings and existing work.

8
00:00:29,307 --> 00:00:35,985
Add one sentence about a check you actually performed, under
your own checking record.

9
00:00:35,985 --> 00:00:39,169
Do not claim a check you did not perform.

10
00:00:39,169 --> 00:00:41,965
Text in the editor is not yet saved.

11
00:00:41,965 --> 00:00:45,693
Pause and write your sentence in your own words.

12
00:00:45,693 --> 00:00:48,693
Pause here and check your own screen.

13
00:00:48,693 --> 00:00:53,123
Choose Preview and check how the text appears to a reader.

14
00:00:53,123 --> 00:00:56,789
Confirm your sentence and headings are readable.

15
00:00:56,789 --> 00:00:59,844
Return to Edit if you need a correction.

16
00:00:59,844 --> 00:01:04,350
Preview checks the appearance; it does not save the change.

17
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:05,954
Pause and inspect it.

18
00:01:05,954 --> 00:01:08,954
Pause here and check your own screen.

19
00:01:08,954 --> 00:01:12,481
Click Commit changes to open the save dialog.

20
00:01:12,481 --> 00:01:16,478
Enter a brief message, such as Add checking record.

21
00:01:16,478 --> 00:01:24,785
In your own course repository, choose Commit directly to the
main branch and confirm with the final Commit

22
00:01:24,785 --> 00:01:25,961
changes button.

23
00:01:25,961 --> 00:01:29,879
Reopen README to check that your sentence remains.

24
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:32,858
Browser saving needs no separate push.

25
00:01:32,858 --> 00:01:34,895
Pause and reopen the file.

26
00:01:34,895 --> 00:01:37,895
Pause here and check your own screen.
